docs {
  # Create Study

  새 검사를 생성합니다.

  ## Request Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | patientId | number | **Yes** | 환자 ID |
  | studyInstanceUid | string | No | DICOM Study Instance UID (자동 생성 가능) |
  | studyDate | string | No | 검사 날짜 (YYYY-MM-DD) |
  | studyDescription | string | No | 검사 설명 |

  ## Request Example

  ```json
  {
    "patientId": 1,
    "studyInstanceUid": "1.2.840.113619.2.1.20260108",
    "studyDate": "2026-01-08",
    "studyDescription": "Echocardiogram"
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  {
    "code": 201000,
    "message": "Created",
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "uuid": "01936b6c-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc",
      "patientId": 1,
      "patientName": "Hong Gildong",
      "studyInstanceUid": "1.2.840.113619.2.1.20260108",
      "studyDate": "2026-01-08",
      "studyDescription": "Echocardiogram",
      "numberOfSeries": 0,
      "numberOfInstances": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "tenantId": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error (400) - Validation Error
  ```json
  {
    "code": 400000,
    "message": "Patient ID is required",
    "data": null
  }
  ```

  ### Error (404) - Patient Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": 404000,
    "message": "Patient not found",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
}
